window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A king without a crown, a soldier on a desperate mission, and a planet on the brink of war. Teodor, the young king of Earth, is trapped in a brutal alien world, fighting for survival among the enigmatic Spider Riders. His friend, Guy Erma, a captain in the Dome Militant, embarks on a perilous journey across the treacherous landscapes of Sas Darona to rescue him.</p> <p>As Guy and his team delve deeper into the alien wilderness, they uncover a web of deceit and betrayal that threatens to shatter the fragile peace between the tribes and the Dodecahedral Empire. With time running out and the fate of Sas Darona hanging in the balance, Guy must use all his cunning and skill to reunite with Teodor and expose the truth behind the escalating conflict.</p> <p><i>Captain of Empire</i> is a thrilling science fiction adventure filled with action, intrigue, and unexpected alliances. With its richly detailed world, compelling characters, and heart-pounding action, this novel will transport you to a world where loyalty is tested, friendships are forged, and the fight for freedom is never-ending.</p> <p>If you crave action-packed science fiction with a touch of political intrigue and a dash of romance, then <i>Captain of Empire</i> is the perfect listen for you.</p> <p>Embark on an unforgettable journey across the stars and discover the true meaning of courage and sacrifice.</p>"; 
